00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:02.133
It said, "...The House
of Representatives."

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.634
"...the airport
The day before Thanksgiving."

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.300
...the milk table at Starbucks."

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.400
Disaster.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.033
Next up, I typed in,

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.968
"How to hide from..."

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:17.067
